{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does", "label": "ADR 0012: Normalise a host the way Ollama's own CLI does", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "adr_id": "0012", "status": "Accepted", "date": "2026-08-20"}, {"id": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_host_normalisation", "label": "Host normalisation mirroring Ollama's envconfig.Host()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A scheme-less host gets http:// and, when no port is named, 11434, matching OLLAMA_HOST parsing. A host written with a scheme is used as written so http://ollama.example.com keeps meaning port 80; explicit ports and paths (Ollama under a prefix) are kept; https:// preserved for a remote Ollama behind a reverse proxy; trailing slashes removed so appending /api/chat never doubles a separator. The first implementation defaulted 11434 for URL hosts too; corrected in commit d8cf761."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_ollama_host_env_var", "label": "$OLLAMA_HOST environment variable", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same variable Ollama's own CLI reads, so a machine configured for 'ollama run' needs no describe-it-specific configuration. Resolved only by Describer, never by OllamaClient: the transport reads no ambient configuration."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_ollama_envconfig_host", "label": "Ollama envconfig.Host() parsing", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does", "target": "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_08_19_describe_it_design", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does", "target": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_host_normalisation", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does", "target": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_ollama_host_env_var", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does", "target": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_ollama_envconfig_host", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_host_normalisation", "target": "docs_adr_0012_normalise_a_host_the_way_ollamas_cli_does_ollama_envconfig_host", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0012-normalise-a-host-the-way-ollamas-cli-does.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0012_normali